a mistake and I think

00:15:20.991 --> 00:15:23.130
Microsoft with this commitment

00:15:23.131 --> 00:15:25.480
that it is making to
Microsoft Research and to

00:15:25.481 --> 00:15:27.830
the scientific
community is really

00:15:27.831 --> 00:15:32.905
