At the top is the Microsoft
Research mission,

00:16:39.256 --> 00:16:42.070
the advancing
the state of the art,

00:16:42.071 --> 00:16:44.275
which is what we do with you,

00:16:44.276 --> 00:16:47.305
where we engage with you in
the scientific communities,

00:16:47.306 --> 00:16:50.865
rapidly transfer
this innovation into

00:16:50.866 --> 00:16:55.165
impact and just increasing
the vibrancy of the company.

00:16:55.166 --> 00:16:59.580
This mission has been
unchanged since 1991.

00:16:59.581 --> 00:17:04.560
The bottom layer is
something that Eric actually

00:17:04.561 --> 00:17:06.940
