00:17:06.941 --> 00:17:09.860
saying and this is our fabric,

00:17:09.861 --> 00:17:12.570
our culture, our value system.

00:17:12.571 --> 00:17:15.700
This is creativity just having

00:17:15.701 --> 00:17:18.705
ideas and we enjoy
the ideas, collaboration,

00:17:18.706 --> 00:17:20.000
working with you, working

00:17:20.001 --> 00:17:22.450
together within
Microsoft Research,

00:17:22.451 --> 00:17:25.305
within Microsoft product groups
but also with you.

00:17:25.306 --> 00:17:30.245
Diversity and joy, having fun.

00:17:30.246 --> 00:17:36.860
The important thing
also is of course also

00:17:36.861 --> 00:17:39.430
