and create research labs.

00:17:44.801 --> 00:17:46.560
But this fabric is not

00:17:46.561 --> 00:17:48.845
something that you
build in five years.

00:17:48.846 --> 00:17:50.110
This takes a long,

00:17:50.111 --> 00:17:52.060
long time and I think this is

00:17:52.061 --> 00:17:54.240
what makes Microsoft
Research so unique.

00:17:54.241 --> 00:17:56.280
This is clearly I
get to asked a lot,

00:17:56.281 --> 00:17:59.430
why did you go to Microsoft
Research from ETH which

00:17:59.431 --> 00:18:00.775
