00:18:42.121 --> 00:18:44.440
This is a very important part of

00:18:44.441 --> 00:18:46.090
Microsoft Research and

00:18:46.091 --> 00:18:48.970
Sandy's organization
helps everybody,

00:18:48.971 --> 00:18:51.355
me as a researcher or

00:18:51.356 --> 00:18:56.165
my team as research team
