is that we create surprises.

00:19:02.621 --> 00:19:05.585
That's really what
Microsoft Research is about

00:19:05.586 --> 00:19:09.950
and and we have
all these dialogues

00:19:09.951 --> 00:19:14.410
and what gives us
the most pleasure is if we give

00:19:14.411 --> 00:19:16.870
