they say, "Oh yeah, yeah.

00:19:19.671 --> 00:19:21.550
I hadn't thought about that."

00:19:21.551 --> 00:19:24.230
Of course, again
we can only create

00:19:24.231 --> 00:19:27.210
surprises together
with you because

00:19:27.211 --> 00:19:29.080
creating some of these surprises

00:19:29.081 --> 00:19:30.390
are putting many pieces of

00:19:30.391 --> 00:19:32.400
the puzzle together and you are

00:19:32.401 --> 00:19:35.690
the people who create
many of these pieces.

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:39.600
Tomorrow, I'm going to
give some examples of

00:19:39.601 --> 00:19:44.000
