but some of you

00:22:46.371 --> 00:22:48.350
maybe just want to be on

00:22:48.351 --> 00:22:51.145
the invention side and
you have through us,

00:22:51.146 --> 00:22:56.500
you have a vehicle to get
your inventions to impact.

00:22:57.200 --> 00:23:03.180
This is an opportunity that
